# v0.215.0 Release Notes

File: openOODA/audit/release_notes/RELEASE_NOTES_v0.212.0.oot

Release: v0.215.0
Date: 2026-08-26
Tag: v0.215.0

## Product Path

C emit + `chs_rt` + gcc/clang pure multi-module compiler pipeline, plus the
LLVM IR emit path. Build #8 (c_emit Gate 2) is now resolved by the
parallel c_emit fix commit `09ba1425`. The in-tree `oodac/oodac` binary
at 07:09 contains all LLVM lane fixes.

## LLVM Lane Fixes — VERIFIED on rebuilt binary

1. **`oodac/llvm_emit_fn.oo:78-97`** — Parameter type parser consumes
   `KW_MUT` after `AMP` and lowers `&mut Name` to `%struct.Name*`.
2. **`oodac/llvm_emit_ty.oo:190-213`** — `llvm_ty_ok_res` recognises
   all 8 2-payload cross-product types (`%OoResII`..`%OoResFF`).
3. **`oodac/llvm_emit_result.oo:83-100, 168-191`** — `llvm_res_tri2`
   emits 2-payload Result with distinct Ok/Err slot types.
   `llvm_emit_none` dispatches the Err slot type for both single-payload
   (always %OoStr) and 2-payload cross-products (i64, i32, double).
4. **`oodac/llvm_emit_match_expr.oo:155-167`** — `is_res` accepts
   8 2-payload cross-product types.
5. **`oodac/llvm_emit_match_slot.oo:12-19, 22-46`** — `llvm_match_is_res`
   accepts cross-products; `llvm_match_pay_ty` returns correct slot
   types and `llvm_match_pay_idx` returns index 2 for 2-payload Err.
6. **`oodac/llvm_emit_match_expr_arc.oo:13-33`** — `llvm_mex_is_str_result`
   accepts all 2-payload cross-products.

