## Script Hygiene

1. **`scripts/llvm_repro_smoke.oo:103,151,173,177`** — Four bare
   `process_exec` calls wrapped with `let _rN = process_exec(...)`.
2. **`scripts/llvm_product_smoke.oo`** — `let _ =` replaced with
   `if X.is_err() { fail("..."); }`. `fail()` does `process_exit(1)`.
   Removed `.unwrap_or(...)` and `.unwrap()` calls — replaced with
   `process_exec("realpath .")` + `chars_len(out) > 0` checks.
3. **`scripts/llvm_codegen_smoke.oo`** — `let _ =` removed; expect_*
   and check calls refactored into `List[String]` key loops with
   `if X.is_err() { fail("..."); }` consumption.

